{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "01TO", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$x \\in X$", "MATH_0004": "$\\Spec(A) = U \\subset X$", "MATH_0005": "$x$", "MATH_0006": "$\\Spec(R) = V \\subset S$", "MATH_0007": "$f(U) \\subset V$", "MATH_0008": "$R \\to A$", "MATH_0009": "$f$", "MATH_0010": "$X$", "MATH_0011": "$f$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0002": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0003": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0002": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0003": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-finite-presentation}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:68dd16c2cbe8006bf68f241c73cccf0a9fe9704b4f68a41eeb6d1d1ceda277c4", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b875aec2247409b3c1812c8da08532eabcbd7644c678446e0c8e2060745ffc74", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> We say that <MATH_0002> is of <TEXTITOPEN_0001>finite presentation at <MATH_0003><TEXTITCLOSE_0001> if\nthere exists an affine open neighbourhood <MATH_0004>\nof <MATH_0005> and affine open <MATH_0006>\nwith <MATH_0007> such that the induced ring map\n<MATH_0008> is of finite presentation.\n<STRUCT_0003> We say that <MATH_0009> is <TEXTITOPEN_0002>locally of finite presentation<TEXTITCLOSE_0002> if it is\nof finite presentation at every point of <MATH_0010>.\n<STRUCT_0004> We say that <MATH_0011> is of <TEXTITOPEN_0003>finite presentation<TEXTITCLOSE_0003> if it is locally of\nfinite presentation, quasi-compact and quasi-separated.\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ccf23e942fdb209bd065eceb9593ab8d93bb397ca26443aa5cda8ed33c9f3514", "unit_id